Outfit and Zen Kaku Gothic New, the fonts of the AutumnBSD desktop and
of its login screen, Akture, as published by Google Fonts.

Outfit is a geometric sans serif by Rodrigo Fuenzalida, as a variable
font with weights from 100 to 900.  Zen Kaku Gothic New is a Japanese
gothic typeface by Yoshimichi Ohira, in five weights from Light to
Black.  Both are under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
